  id: VAULT_DOOR
  title: the vault door
  about: the steel blast door out of the vault, from inside. It froze into its frame
    behind the Lindqvist brothers 71 years ago, and protocol 2 keeps it shut anyway.
    Heat would melt the ice (a fire beside it, a torch held to it); a hard blow would
    break it
  top: {fileID: 0}
  known: 1
